Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:26.39,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:33.81,0:01:35.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.24,0:01:37.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They left Garp\Non Pirate Island?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.35,0:01:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.58,0:01:42.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The article says he went there\Nto rescue some guy named Koby.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.16,0:01:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess he succeeded.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.43,0:01:44.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad it cost him his life.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.02,0:01:46.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where does it say he's dead?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.90,0:01:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The man's a living legend.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't how he's gonna go.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.11,0:01:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wipe those looks\Noff your faces?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.98,0:01:52.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:52.81,0:01:53.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.89,0:01:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn right he is.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.25,0:01:59.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's laughing?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.45,0:02:01.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think this is funny?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.29,0:02:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.28,0:02:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.11,0:02:07.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.45,0:02:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.37,0:02:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was just the baby.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Makino.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.94,0:02:14.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're worried about\NGarp too, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.78,0:02:16.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that what you\Nwere laughing at?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.62,0:02:18.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know Luffy's\Nface now, don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.89,0:02:20.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We love Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.08,0:02:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.83,0:02:27.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are\Nthose idiots thinking?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.91,0:02:46.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, we got a big one!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.55,0:02:49.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.30,0:03:07.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.60,0:03:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.46,0:03:14.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.16,0:03:21.60,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The earthquake on that day was\Nunlike any other in recorded history.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.68,0:03:25.66,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It caused devastating\Ndamage all around the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.20,0:03:48.14,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The situation was\Nhighly unusual.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.22,0:03:51.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The earthquake's epicenter\Ncould not be detected.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.39,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The truth was hidden\Nfrom the public.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.47,0:03:57.66,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,But it was no coincidence that the tragedy\Noccurred six days after the kingdom of
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.74,0:04:00.56,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Lulusia was wiped off the map\Nby the World Government.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.64,0:04:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm at the remains of Lulusia!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.72,0:04:04.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no trace\Nof the land anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.06,0:04:07.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just a giant hole\Nswallowing up the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No further approach\Nis possible!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.27,0:04:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hole isn't filling!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.77,0:04:19.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Across the entire world, sea levels Rose\Nby approximately one meter following the
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.20,0:04:20.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,havoc of the earthquake.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.84,0:04:25.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The beach has never\Nflooded like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.61,0:04:32.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this rate, there won't be\Nany beach left here at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why isn't the tide\Npulling back?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.58,0:04:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is too cruel!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.00,0:04:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Running on the beach\Nis our favorite pastime!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.12,0:04:42.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.43,0:04:44.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't glamorous at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.01,0:04:52.63,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,A number of beaches have disappeared\Nfrom the world, along with several islands.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.70,0:04:56.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing\Nleft for us here!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.76,0:04:57.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.77,0:04:59.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My sharks swim\Nright into my house!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.33,0:05:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not supposed\Nto be high tide yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.33,0:05:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Might make for a big\Ncatch, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.25,0:05:08.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really want to go\Nsailing in this mess?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.63,0:05:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sir, an update\Non the flooding situation.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.98,0:05:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sea levels are rising\Naround the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.09,0:05:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.96,0:05:20.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the cause is unclear.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.39,0:05:26.93,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Egghead was surrounded by\Na fleet of 100 Navy vessels of various
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.01,0:05:30.13,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,sizes, including 20\Nmassive battleships.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.21,0:05:34.64,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This was a force that could level a nation,\Nwith power far exceeding even
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.72,0:05:35.82,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,that of a Buster Call.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.30,0:05:39.59,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,523)}The total number\Nof marines was 30,000.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.91,0:05:44.03,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,And the leaders of\Nthis unprecedented operation...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.92,0:05:53.26,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...were nine Navy\NHQ Vice-Admirals...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and Admiral Kizaru.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.17,0:06:06.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're under attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.31,0:06:43.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.87,0:06:47.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I told you not to attack\Nthe sea beast's weapons!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.22,0:06:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard you.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.15,0:06:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid it\Nattacked us first.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your meal is served, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.03,0:06:58.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my favorite.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.68,0:07:00.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you go!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.53,0:07:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat it while it's hot!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.49,0:07:13.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I gotta say, you're really putting\Nme on the spot here, Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.93,0:07:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just surrender and have\Na nice bowl of ramen with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.78,0:07:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Get serious!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.89,0:07:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Attack again\Nand we'll open fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.24,0:07:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ooh, now you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.38,0:07:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what you're\Nup against here!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.45,0:07:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk developed the pacifista's\Nlasers by studying your power!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.59,0:07:31.39,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.22,0:07:34.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.44,0:07:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now you're here\Nto murder him.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.19,0:07:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never thought things\Nwould turn out this way.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.48,0:07:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He studied the Void\NCentury, Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.30,0:07:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Old friend or not, I can't\Ndefend a crime like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.09,0:07:48.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the end, I'm just\Nthe Navy's puppet.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.01,0:07:53.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That said, we don't want to have\Nthis battle any more than you do.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.83,0:07:56.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The more we destroy,\Nthe more we lose.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.16,0:08:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was really hoping Lucci would clean\Nthis up quickly without me.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.73,0:08:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop trashing the place.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.12,0:08:04.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can thank the Straw\NHats for that one.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.71,0:08:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let anyone\Nelse know I'm here.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.14,0:08:12.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.64,0:08:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats took Vegapunk hostage\Nand barricaded themselves inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.89,0:08:20.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I like this article.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.10,0:08:22.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Morgan's work.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.82,0:08:24.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what is the truth?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.51,0:08:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir, we haven't received word that\NCP0 has completed their mission.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.16,0:08:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru is prepared\Nto defend the island outside.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.77,0:08:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we can guess who's\Nin the Labophase.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.89,0:08:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, we have Dr. Vegapunk\Nalong with his six satellites.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.09,0:08:43.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They should have the four\Nseraphim protecting them.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.37,0:08:48.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then there's Straw Hat Luffy and his crew,\Nwho seem to have allied with the Doctor.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.00,0:08:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, there's CP0's Rob Lucci,\Nalong with the others in his leading unit,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaku and Stussy.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.96,0:09:01.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for the other Cipher Pol agents,\Nthey appear to have been captured by
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.41,0:09:03.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru and\Nhis pacifistas as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.30,0:09:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're probably\Nin the Fabriophase.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.19,0:09:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One added note.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.92,0:09:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Frontier Dome's barrier status is\Ncurrently at 100%, meaning that no one
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.13,0:09:14.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,can enter or leave\Nthe Labophase.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.21,0:09:17.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been like that\Nfor an entire day.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.55,0:09:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We still don't know\Nwhat's going on inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.20,0:09:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to all the research staff\Nand technicians who were employed on
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Egghead?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.89,0:09:27.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not present.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.03,0:09:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They evacuated\Nthe island yesterday.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.23,0:09:32.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've already\Nlocated their ships.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.32,0:09:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what if they\Nknow too much?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.68,0:09:37.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sink them at once.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.59,0:09:38.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.16,0:09:40.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just one more thing first.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.22,0:09:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We spotted Jewelry Bonney.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.05,0:09:45.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She may be there\Nwith the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.55,0:09:47.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma's daughter, you say?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.54,0:09:49.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have no more use for her.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.04,0:09:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget about her.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.59,0:09:53.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's just a girl.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.26,0:09:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.45,0:09:58.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Admiral, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.45,0:10:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.38,0:10:04.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to enjoy\Na meal here.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.62,0:10:06.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're picking up a signal\Ncoming from Egghead.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.91,0:10:07.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A signal?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.39,0:10:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They seem to be making\Na call somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.61,0:10:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll find out who\Nthey're calling, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.50,0:10:18.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Mary Geoise!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.01,0:10:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.13,0:10:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Admiral, you should have a black\Ntransponder snail on your wrist.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.97,0:10:30.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.03,0:10:32.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can tap the call.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.47,0:10:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.71,0:10:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.64,0:10:44.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.27,0:10:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}York!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.37,0:10:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.83,0:10:48.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's all you have to say?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.57,0:10:49.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.93,0:10:52.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why the hell are you\Ntrying to kill me, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.09,0:10:54.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm the one who told\Nyou what Stella did.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.47,0:10:55.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Remember that, Peapaws?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.28,0:11:00.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, you're still\Na Vegapunk, just like the others.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.07,0:11:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't give a shit about\Nthe Void Century!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.96,0:11:06.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And even if I did, you think\NI would have taken it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.06,0:11:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tipped you off about it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.93,0:11:08.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use your brains!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.53,0:11:11.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.79,0:11:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how did you survive?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.72,0:11:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did CP0 fail at their mission?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.43,0:11:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And what is the status\Nof the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.38,0:11:23.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm still here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.15,0:11:25.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That alone should tell\Nyou how the others are?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.89,0:11:28.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the one calling\Nthe shots now!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.22,0:11:31.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Egghead is mine.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.26,0:11:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.71,0:11:39.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,About your little fleet\Nsurrounding the island...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.03,0:11:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You trying to start a war\Nwith me or something?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.18,0:11:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We could be convinced\Nto alter our plans, York.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.94,0:11:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But let me confirm\None thing first.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.05,0:11:54.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you create the Mother\NFlame yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.96,0:12:02.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, now they\Nwant to negotiate.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.42,0:12:04.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm glad I sent\Nyou that sample.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.49,0:12:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew you'd get hooked\Nonce you had a piece.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is of the highest priority.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.04,0:12:12.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whose priority, I wonder?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.40,0:12:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Too bad this island's the only\Npower plant that makes it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.71,0:12:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here's the sitch.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.52,0:12:32.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Promise that me and the lab will make\Nit out of this thing unscathed.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.48,0:12:33.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.96,0:12:36.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And make me a Celestial Dragon\Nwhile you're at it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.34,0:12:37.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It shall be done.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.38,0:12:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we've got\Nourselves a deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.29,0:12:42.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.94,0:12:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need you to come\Nand save me!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.68,0:12:49.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is here!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.81,0:12:53.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.81,0:12:54.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.62,0:12:56.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on in there?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.42,0:13:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.56,0:13:03.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should we\Ndo with this one?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.55,0:13:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No more use\Nfor her now, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.52,0:13:08.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast them all dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.97,0:13:09.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.70,0:13:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.42,0:13:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do it now, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a disaster this has been!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.31,0:13:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've caused you\Nall such trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.09,0:13:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.00,0:13:21.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We forgive you,\Nbut she is a different story.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.65,0:13:23.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, Luffy, what's\Nthe plan for her?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.74,0:13:27.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They want to keep\Nher alive, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.25,0:13:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's use her as a shield\Nwhen we run away.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.80,0:13:33.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's like a hostage\Nsituation, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.87,0:13:34.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talk to me, Doc.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.94,0:13:35.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is she gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.98,0:13:40.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll take time for her wounds to heal,\Nbut with plenty of rest, she'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.00,0:13:43.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.59,0:13:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.76,0:13:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name is... Monkey D.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.82,0:13:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.62,0:13:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm gonna be\NKing of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.82,0:13:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what you\Nchoose to open with?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.15,0:13:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.57,0:13:57.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have Dr. Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.53,0:13:59.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All the Vegapunks, even!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.90,0:14:04.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you want to save York's life,\Nclear your ships from the shore!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.47,0:14:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Every last one!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.31,0:14:07.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't understand!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.99,0:14:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is a monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.42,0:14:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.42,0:14:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's torturing her!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.02,0:14:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rumors are true!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.85,0:14:15.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a menace!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.12,0:14:18.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.94,0:14:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.73,0:14:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, why?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.14,0:14:22.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That story was fake!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.99,0:14:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So you're Straw\NHat Luffy, are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.55,0:14:27.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you suffered any\Ncasualties in the lab?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.97,0:14:29.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is still there with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.25,0:14:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, let me see.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.28,0:14:34.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A couple of people are hurt...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.72,0:14:35.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.99,0:14:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galick.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.58,0:14:39.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.63,0:14:41.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A woman's voice.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.53,0:14:43.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Must be Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.62,0:14:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd you make me hang up?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.46,0:14:46.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Intel is a weapon.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.39,0:14:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must never give\Nit to your enemies.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.96,0:14:50.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.73,0:14:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.52,0:14:54.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But hey, the ships\Nwill be gone now, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.24,0:14:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like hell they will!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.29,0:14:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think the Navy's\Nthat dumb?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.72,0:15:01.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's our next move?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.14,0:15:03.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are three things\Nwe must protect.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.63,0:15:04.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,York's safety.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.52,0:15:08.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The data stored\Ninside Punk Records.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.86,0:15:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the power plant that\Ncreates the Mother Flame.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.36,0:15:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everything else is expendable.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.80,0:15:20.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But sir, Rob Lucci and the other Cipher\NPol agents are still trapped inside there.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.37,0:15:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We might face\Na worst-case scenario.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.09,0:15:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must prioritize\Naccordingly.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.15,0:15:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Regard humans as\Nyou regard insects.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.23,0:15:33.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if you exterminate some,\Nthey'll multiply again.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.93,0:15:34.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.77,0:15:36.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.08,0:15:39.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.11,0:15:43.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You listen to me,\Nyou tiny terrorists!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.57,0:15:46.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I made a pact with the Five\NElders, you get it?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.50,0:15:48.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurt me and you die!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.13,0:15:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What they do to this island\Nwill make Ohara look like fireworks!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.51,0:15:59.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.73,0:16:04.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll sic the Elders on you first!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.59,0:16:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.08,0:16:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.86,0:16:11.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're lucky that's all you got!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.57,0:16:13.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you say\Nthat in front of Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.75,0:16:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep your filthy mouth shut!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.46,0:16:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She can't hurt us.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.96,0:16:18.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just ignore her.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.79,0:16:22.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin, are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.64,0:16:23.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.54,0:16:24.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you met my doctor?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.07,0:16:25.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's brilliant.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.85,0:16:28.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make me\Nhappy at all, you jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.35,0:16:30.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.95,0:16:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty pathetic display.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.62,0:16:36.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though to be fair, I was\Nfighting two seraphim at once.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.32,0:16:40.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need to rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.78,0:16:43.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaka!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.36,0:16:46.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pythagoras!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.97,0:16:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Edison!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.45,0:16:49.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.40,0:16:55.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you quiet\Ndown for a sec?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.99,0:16:56.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.48,0:16:59.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get in contact\Nwith the basement right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.74,0:17:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you guys hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.15,0:17:04.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone's still alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.16,0:17:06.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.73,0:17:07.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh heh heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.02,0:17:10.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We can finally eat again!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.76,0:17:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You saved us!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.00,0:17:13.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We were losing hope!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.85,0:17:15.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.22,0:17:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, do I love\Nthe Straw Hat crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.84,0:17:23.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't laugh, buddy.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.24,0:17:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're still enemies.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.63,0:17:27.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, is there any chance you\Ncould let us out of this room?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.32,0:17:31.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm glad everyone's okay, but we\Nreally can't do that right now, sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fair enough,\Nbut could you relocate us?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.07,0:17:36.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's kinda\Nnerve-wracking in here.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.17,0:17:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With them around.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.46,0:17:38.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.25,0:17:40.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you guys afraid\Nof the seraphim?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.68,0:17:43.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to be on the same\Nside as you guys, aren't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.36,0:17:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.31,0:17:46.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What if they go berserk?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.79,0:17:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's nothing\Nto worry about, is there?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.18,0:17:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, they're safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.76,0:17:55.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those bubble balls are made of the same\Nmaterial as the pacifista Mark III's
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.41,0:17:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}bubble shields.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.69,0:17:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're resilient enough\Nto deflect Cannon blasts.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.50,0:18:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're also created with sea energy,\Nmaking them the perfect prison to contain
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}those with devil fruit powers.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.78,0:18:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought they were\Njust regular bubbles.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.52,0:18:13.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you trap\Nme in this damn thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is foolish to be afraid of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.47,0:18:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We do our job, and none of the seraphim\Nwere ordered to kill you.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're of no interest to us!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.15,0:18:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, now I just feel silly.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.98,0:18:29.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't mind the suits,\Neh, Snake?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.94,0:18:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're just chompy.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.99,0:18:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're super cool in our book\Nafter what you did before.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.17,0:18:37.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thanks for turning us back\Nfrom stone, little snake.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.11,0:18:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She really did that?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.11,0:18:39.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How peculiar.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.36,0:18:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unless I made an error, that behavior\Nshould not be in the programming.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.46,0:18:47.09,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.09,0:18:48.32,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, Hancock!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.41,0:18:49.57,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,They're my friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.66,0:18:51.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta undo\Nthis stone thing now!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.31,0:18:54.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the only person\Nwho can save them!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.38,0:18:55.14,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So please!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.13,0:18:59.17,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.95,0:19:00.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I will do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.35,0:19:03.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Just please stop\Nstaring at me like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.74,0:19:06.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see how it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.00,0:19:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's just as unmanageable as the original\NHancock, with the same soft spot for
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.50,0:19:12.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.14,0:19:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is too funny!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.06,0:19:17.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know seraphim\Nworked that way!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.79,0:19:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Hancock!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.26,0:19:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How's it going?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.15,0:19:25.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems the information transmitted\Nthrough bloodline elements is broader than
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.12,0:19:25.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.91,0:19:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were super\Nawesome back there!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.25,0:19:29.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I owe you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.35,0:19:31.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I owe you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.01,0:19:34.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you just say I love you?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.23,0:19:46.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Stella, we've got trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.52,0:19:50.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The communication system's been fully\Nrestored, but the Frontier Dome still
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.62,0:19:52.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,won't open for some reason.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.63,0:19:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't even bother.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.96,0:19:58.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I protected the Dome\Nwith a passcode,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.04,0:20:00.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but my brain's not synced\Nwith all of you anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.01,0:20:02.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm not telling!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.62,0:20:03.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.37,0:20:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, beat it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.88,0:20:07.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.86,0:20:13.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While all of you lose your minds,\NI'm gonna rest easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.91,0:20:16.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, go fetch me a snack.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.51,0:20:18.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Snack on my fist, you pig!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.98,0:20:21.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can't deactivate the barrier,\Nthen we can't escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.86,0:20:25.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all my smooth talking,\NI thought we were free.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.63,0:20:27.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're a real diplomat.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.04,0:20:36.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Four seriously injured.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.25,0:20:39.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two of Vegapunk's\Nsatellites dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.66,0:20:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for the straw hats...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.25,0:20:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're mumbling.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.24,0:20:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.57,0:20:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just talking to myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.30,0:20:54.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I checked outside and we're\Ncompletely surrounded in all directions.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.38,0:20:55.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello, Stussy!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.71,0:20:58.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like 100 ships.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.24,0:21:00.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd assume there are\Naround 30,000 marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.32,0:21:03.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My, this is quite ze event.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.43,0:21:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, my darling!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.98,0:21:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Care for a cup of coffee?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.18,0:21:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.13,0:21:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop glaring at me.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.82,0:21:14.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're Nami, correct?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.49,0:21:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The cruise navigator?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.88,0:21:16.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.55,0:21:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.64,0:21:19.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How does our route look?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.24,0:21:24.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, the Log Pose hasn't recorded a signal,\Nbut we still have one steady needle from
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:25.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.08,0:21:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems we'll be\Ngoing northeast.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.34,0:21:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, that would be Elbaph.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.96,0:21:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbaph?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.71,0:21:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.03,0:21:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.37,0:21:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.83,0:21:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess so, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.32,0:21:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what's there?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.63,0:21:39.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Giants!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.01,0:21:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ The Giants! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.67,0:21:43.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ The Giants! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.43,0:21:46.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why are they so\Nexcited about this?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.36,0:21:52.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We do have one advantage.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.72,0:21:56.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your ship is up here in the Labophase,\Nwithin our grasp.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.13,0:21:58.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy ships are\Noffshore in all directions.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.17,0:22:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would be impossible\Nto sail out of the port.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.23,0:22:04.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said that we'll be heading\Ntoward the northeast.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.94,0:22:07.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the back\Nside of the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.59,0:22:11.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luckily, your ship is waiting right\Nnext to the Vegaforce-01.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.42,0:22:15.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With a little rocket propulsion,\Nit should be able to carry us clean
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.43,0:22:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,over the Navy blockade.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.73,0:22:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the downside, Vegaforce-01 can only\Nfly within the airspace over Egghead.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.27,0:22:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So let's hope we get enough\Ndistance before we take a nosedive.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.62,0:22:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way\Nthat'll be far enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.56,0:22:27.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got you, Doc!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.82,0:22:31.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just do the best you can, then\Nthe Sunny's coup de burst will carry us
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.33,0:22:32.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the rest of the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.42,0:22:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll fly a whole kilometer!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.31,0:22:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way they'll\Ncatch us after that!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.58,0:22:37.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My goodness!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.66,0:22:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How in the world\Ncan your ship fly so far?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.18,0:22:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cola power, Vegabro!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.45,0:22:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cola power?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.80,0:22:53.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.65,0:22:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds like a plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.07,0:22:55.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.18,0:22:57.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.63,0:22:59.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you head to Vegaforce-01\Nnow?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.92,0:23:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.34,0:23:05.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want me to move the Straw Hat's\Nship to the back side of the island, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.00,0:23:06.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll help, you.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.27,0:23:08.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we still can't go\Nanywhere till we do that.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.21,0:23:10.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to deactivate\Nthe darn Frontier Dome!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.03,0:23:12.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm never gonna\Nhand over the code!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.22,0:23:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll crack it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.27,0:23:22.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll crack the punk out of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.19,0:23:27.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like our plan is\Ncoming together nicely.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.66,0:23:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet there's absolutely zero chance\Nwe pull this off without a hitch.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.00,0:23:35.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all we got, and we\Ndon't know till we try.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.78,0:23:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.10,0:23:39.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're going to the Sunny,\Ntake me with.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.89,0:23:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is my baby, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.81,0:23:42.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take me, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.89,0:23:44.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see elbow!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.87,0:23:45.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.85,0:23:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me help out!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.05,0:23:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.09,0:23:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.88,0:24:01.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.96,0:24:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get your ship\Nto the back side, quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.07,0:24:14.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Knowing them, they'll have\Nthat Frontier Dome down soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.60,0:24:15.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That might be good.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.62,0:24:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or it might just cause\Neven more problems.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.72,0:24:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.45,0:24:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't you\Nwant it down?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.05,0:24:21.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cause there's the catch.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.26,0:24:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can get out,\Nthe Feds can get in.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.64,0:24:26.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we're not ready to rock\Nwhen it opens, we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.68,0:24:28.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.60,0:24:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is so much fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.63,0:24:31.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never left Egghead!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.52,0:24:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,World, here I come!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.88,0:24:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, Doc!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.57,0:24:34.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ain't a road trip!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.91,0:24:37.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just thought of something.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.95,0:24:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need\Nso much more food!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.15,0:24:42.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.33,0:24:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll eat all of this in one day!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.94,0:24:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do we even have pizzas?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.27,0:24:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.76,0:24:46.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's super important!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.60,0:24:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to get\Na ton of cheese!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.52,0:24:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think we have everything else\NSanji needs to make them for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.45,0:24:52.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.85,0:24:54.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That guy's pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.41,0:24:56.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a good cook\Nand a good fighter.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.49,0:24:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.51,0:24:58.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.72,0:25:01.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's got you in such\Na happy mood all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.87,0:25:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Earlier you wanted\Nto kill Old Man Apple.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.71,0:25:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.53,0:25:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.35,0:25:12.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm over that now.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.52,0:25:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.12,0:25:17.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So why were you\Ncrying all night?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.74,0:25:18.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.43,0:25:19.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was not!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.15,0:25:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We received\Na transmission from Lucci!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.57,0:25:26.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We know the situation\Ninside the dome now.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.46,0:25:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Share it with the other ships.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.30,0:25:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.86,0:25:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Borsalino?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.36,0:25:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.91,0:25:48.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He talked a big game, but it seems he doesn't\Nhave quite as much leverage as he implied.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.00,0:25:50.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.09,0:25:52.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of them are trapped\Nin that dome like rats.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.72,0:25:57.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it uses a laser defense system,\Ncan't you simply pass through it?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.26,0:26:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are light itself,\Nare you not?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.43,0:26:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, the barrier isn't\Nwhat's stopping me.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.82,0:26:06.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a friend of mine waiting on the shore,\Nand he's determined to protect
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.42,0:26:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.16,0:26:09.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why not fly over him?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.34,0:26:12.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't disrespect a man who's\Nputting everything on the line.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.81,0:26:14.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I like to think I'm\Ncooler than that.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.38,0:26:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At the very least, let me\Nstick to my principles.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.08,0:26:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And remember...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.03,0:26:21.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru is\Npoised to attack.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.07,0:26:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The second we make a move, he'll order\Nevery resource at his command into action.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.34,0:26:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means a swarm of sea beast\Nweapons and fifty pacifistas.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.23,0:26:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bad news for all\Nthe ships we brought.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.19,0:26:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be committing\Nto a massive bloodbath.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.92,0:26:39.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We better settle this quickly.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.78,0:26:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do we know where\Nthe power plant is?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.45,0:26:50.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our friend Lucci hasn't\Nbeen sleeping on the job.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.27,0:26:55.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have all the information we need,\Nand he delivered it straight to our door.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.25,0:27:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Six power masters proceed to land\Nas soon as the battle begins!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.32,0:27:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our mission is to free\Nthe captured Cipher Pol agents!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.31,0:27:23.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artillery fire won't\Nwork on the pacifistas!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.33,0:27:26.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aim all cannons at the sea\Nbeast weapons!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.19,0:27:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunderclap!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.44,0:27:38.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The stars will be...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.66,0:27:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.98,0:27:46.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I love this place too\Nbut we gotta lock in, bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.72,0:27:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Made it, there's the sunny-
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.65,0:28:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No turning back...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.88,0:28:05.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sacred Yata Mirror.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.31,0:28:24.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.78,0:28:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.38,0:28:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pacifistas!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.01,0:28:45.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't go easy on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.61,0:28:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Uncle!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.06,0:28:55.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're facing\Nthe strongest defense...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.46,0:28:58.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the whole world!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.43,0:29:07.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.77,0:29:12.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.57,0:29:14.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is this light\Ncoming from?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.82,0:29:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone's here!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.39,0:29:22.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.65,0:02:52.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an earthquake!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.87,0:03:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, we're too late...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.10,0:27:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(679.5,1053)}– Prepare for battle!\N– Prepare for battle!
